  "statuteText": "71-B:12 Appeal. –\n\nDecisions of the board may be appealed by either party only in accordance with the provisions of RSA 541 as from time to time amended; provided, however, that there shall be only one appeal allowed per person on each parcel of land until such time as a reassessment has been made."
